However, Luck doesn't affect:

* '''{{M|Fortune Telling Machine}}, {{i|Portable Slot}}, {{M|Shell Game}}, {{M|Slot Machine}}:''' Their chance of giving a consumable doesn't increase with Luck. Only {{i|Lucky Foot}} increases the winning chances with these machines.
* '''The activation chance of:''' {{i|Fanny Pack}}, {{i|Dry Baby}}, {{i|The Mulligan}}, {{i|Broken Watch}}, {{i|Infamy}}, {{i|Tech.5}}, {{i|Guppy's Collar}}, {{i|Undefined}} (for {{R|I AM ERROR}} or {{R|Black Market}} teleports), {{i|We Need To Go Deeper!}} (Crawl Spaces | {{Dlc|r}}Only on specific floor tiles), {{i|Pandora's Box}} (as its effects are predetermined depending on which floor it's used on), and {{i|Missing Page 2}}.
* Content from Chests, Pots, Mushrooms, Skulls, Fires, {{R|Devil Room}}s, and {{R|Angel Room}}s.
* {{M|Beggar}}s, {{M|Devil Beggar}}s, {{M|Key Master}}s, and {{M|Bomb Bum}}s aren't affected by Luck.

