=== Other ===
* "Luck Up" [[pill]]s increase luck by 1, and "Luck Down" pills decrease Luck by 1.
* Putting a coin in the {{M|Donation Machine}} has a 2% chance to increase Luck by 1.
** {{dlc|r}} Having {{t|Karma|n}} increases this chance.
* {{dlc+|a}} {{E|Lucky Penny|text=Lucky Pennies}} increase Luck by 1.{{dlc-}}
* {{dlc|a}} In co-op, [[Green Baby]] will occasionally briefly increase Luck by 2. [[Dark Baby]] will occasionally briefly increase all stats, including Luck.
* {{dlc|a+}} Absorbing an item using {{p|Black Rune|n}} can increase Luck by 1.
* {{dlc+|r}} Certain [[Familiar#Wisps|wisps]] (such as those generated by {{i|Fortune Cookie}} + {{i|Book of Virtues}} synergy) increase Luck by 0.2 per wisp.{{dlc-}}

